        <headline>Warning to Sheep Graziers for Flinders and Mid North forecast districts</headline>
        <description>Sheep graziers are warned that cold temperatures and easterly winds are expected during Thursday. Areas likely to be affected include parts of the Flinders and Mid North forecast districts. There is a risk of losses of lambs and sheep exposed to these conditions.</description>
